## 8. Alternatives considered

| Alternative | Why not (for now) |
| --- | --- |
| `Domain=` cookie from a parent domain | Sends the user's Coder token to every workspace app subdomain |
| Query `?coder_session_token=` | Dashboard SPA and OAuth callback don't use it |
| Middle served on each plane host | Works, but couples middle routing to every plane; the bounce keeps middle anywhere |
| Coder device flow via API (external auth) | Cookie-free for GitLab consent, but UX (enter code) and untested with GitLab in Coder |
| Portal owns GitLab OAuth + credential helper | Bypasses Coder external auth; middle would store/refresh GitLab tokens |
| Keep the consent cookie (no `/done`) | Leaves a dashboard session on the plane host for its lifetime |
